WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.019 --> 00:00:02.381
- [Ralph] I got a call from an agent

00:00:02.381 --> 00:00:05.689
who wanted me to go and
audition for a new film

00:00:05.689 --> 00:00:08.129
called the Empire Strikes Back.

00:00:08.129 --> 00:00:11.212
That was how I became a Stormtrooper.

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:13.579
- [Female Narrator]
This whole thing started

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:16.722
because this guy at our office
is really into Star Wars.

00:00:16.722 --> 00:00:18.500
We all have one, right?

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.970
After some pretty serious
internet sleuthing,

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:23.020
I've tracked down this guy.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.540
- [Ralph] My name's Ralph Morse.

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:25.631
- [Female Narrator] He was a Stormtrooper

00:00:25.631 --> 00:00:27.438
in Star Wars episodes five and six.

00:00:27.438 --> 00:00:30.789
That's the Empire Strikes
Back and Return of the Jedi.

00:00:30.789 --> 00:00:34.189
- [Ralph] I was in the get-
my-shuffle ready sequence.

00:00:34.189 --> 00:00:37.229
I decided to carry my gun
left-handed, side saddled,

00:00:37.229 --> 00:00:39.258
like I was carrying a shotgun in the West,

00:00:39.258 --> 00:00:40.378
and it's in the film.

00:00:40.378 --> 00:00:41.628
You can see it.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.829
- [Female Narrator] We're
talking about what it felt like

00:00:43.829 --> 00:00:46.509
to be a Stormtrooper,
and, for the most part,

00:00:46.509 --> 00:00:49.898
that means what it felt
like to wear the costume.

00:00:49.898 --> 00:00:51.840
- [Ralph] I think all the
costumes were the same size,

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.440
and the original model, I
think, was about five foot 10.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.498
Some of the guys who
were either terribly tall

00:00:57.498 --> 00:00:59.978
or terribly short found
the costumes unbearable.

00:00:59.978 --> 00:01:02.320
Once you're in this thing, you
can't really get out of it.

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:03.688
You couldn't really sit down at all.

00:01:03.688 --> 00:01:07.488
You had to kind of lean to one
side, and, if you wanted

00:01:07.488 --> 00:01:09.762
to go to the bathroom, you
needed to prepare yourself.

00:01:09.762 --> 00:01:10.595
- Excuse me.

00:01:10.595 --> 00:01:11.840
- [Ralph] You needed more
than 30 seconds warning.

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:12.728
- Please, can I?

00:01:12.728 --> 00:01:13.561
Oh boy.

00:01:13.561 --> 00:01:15.232
- [Female Narrator] Okay,
but there's the helmet,

00:01:15.232 --> 00:01:17.278
the iconic helmet.

00:01:17.278 --> 00:01:18.901
- [Ralph] The first helmet they gave me,

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:21.002
I couldn't see through
the damn thing at all.

00:01:21.002 --> 00:01:23.341
The other problem we had were our boots.

00:01:23.341 --> 00:01:26.053
They had soles, but they
had no tread in the soles,

00:01:26.053 --> 00:01:27.773
so you would slide all over the place.

00:01:27.773 --> 00:01:29.232
I don't know a Stormtrooper who hasn't,

00:01:29.232 --> 00:01:31.482
at some point, fallen over.

00:01:33.049 --> 00:01:35.228
- [Female Narrator] Alright,
so it wasn't very glamorous,

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:36.450
but it's still cool, right?

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:38.867
'Cause, you know, Star Wars.

00:01:38.867 --> 00:01:41.534
(playful music)

